  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5016.01 Drivers. Vehicles transporting display fireworks shall be driven by a properly licensed driver who is in compliance with Saf-C 600 and Saf-C 1800.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 4-25-09\n\nNew. #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXIRES: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12738, eff 4-30-19",
